  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to KI for leadership program 2024</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till KI f&#xf6;r ledarskapsprogram 2024</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Karolinska Institutet (KI) etablerar i samarbete med Handelsh&#xf6;gskolan i Stockholm, ett utbildningsprogram och plattform f&#xf6;r yrkesverksamma personer i svenska och internationella organisationer, civilsamh&#xe4;llet samt offentlig och privat sektor. Programmet &quot;Ledarskap, politik och diplomati f&#xf6;r h&#xe4;lsa&quot; fr&#xe4;mjar kunskapsutbyte mellan samh&#xe4;llsakt&#xf6;rer och ska st&#xe4;rka institutionell kapacitet inom praktisk h&#xe4;lsodiplomati.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Karolinska Institutet (KI), in collaboration with the Stockholm School of Economics, is establishing an educational program and platform for professionals in Swedish and international organizations, civil society, and the public and private sectors. The program, titled &#x2018;Leadership, Politics, and Diplomacy for Health,&#x2019; aims to facilitate knowledge exchange among stakeholders and enhance institutional capacity in practical health diplomacy.</narrative>
  </description>
